    "html": "<p>In the circuit shown, the cell has negligible internal resistance.</p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>Which equation is correct?</p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"I_{1}=4I_{2}+I_{3}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"I_{1}=4I_{2}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"I_{3}=4I_{2}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"I_{3}=\\frac{4I_{1}}{3}\"></span></li></ol>"
